WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:02,520
What for?

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:03,980
Didn't I just break through?

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:05,180
You don’t know me anymore

4
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:07,580
My hair has grown a lot longer

5
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,220
I don’t know if it will affect the battle.

6
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:19,140
I didn’t expect you to break through three interceptions.

7
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:21,030
This can be considered your opportunity, right?

8
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:24,030
Fortunately, the mysterious spiritual beast under the water did not appear

9
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:26,910
Unknowingly, I really owe Sister Ji a huge favor.

10
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:29,310
I have to find a chance to thank Sister Ji.

11
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:31,150
Thank you for your hard work in protecting the Dharma.

12
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:43,500
It’s you who made the study without division

13
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:46,380
Learn to use silk thread wrapping to prevent blood leakage

14
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:49,480
There is also a blood-preserving elixir. Thank you.

15
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:57,210
This is not the place to talk. Let's go first.
